November 12, 2011, marks the martyrdom anniversary of Iranian military figure Hassan Tehrani Moqaddam, widely regarded as a pioneer of Iran’s missile program. 

He dedicated his life to advancing the country’s aerospace capabilities and was martyred alongside 16 others in an explosion during a missile test.

